WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:05.038
&gt;&gt;&gt; FOUR CHEFS STARTED OUT WITH
THE GOAL OF WOWING OUR JUDGES

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:07.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
USING THE INGREDIENTS IN THEIR
MYSTERY BASKET.

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:10.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
NOW ONLY TWO REMAIN, GEORGINA
AND CLAIR.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:15.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHO WILL IT BE?
&gt;&gt; YOU DID SOME GREAT COOKING

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
OUT THERE.
I THINK EITHER ONE OF US COULD

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
WIN.
&gt;&gt; I THINK YOU COULD WIN OR I

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:23.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
COULD WIN.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHAT I JUST SAID.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; JUDGES, THOSE WERE SOME
REALLY TRICKY BASKETS.

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:29.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUT AFTER THREE ROUNDS WHAT DO
YOU THINK?

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:30.964
&gt;&gt; WELL, GOING BACK TO THE
APPETIZER ROUND, CLAIR REALLY

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
MADE VERY GREAT USE OF THOSE
ARTICHOKE HEARTS.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.401
&gt;&gt; YEAH, THEY WERE SO CRISPY.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, AND SHE WASN'T THROWN

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:37.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
BY THE LOOSE SUGAR.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:42.876
&gt;&gt; BUT SHE HAD A HARDER TIME
WITH THE FIVE-POUND HORSE PENIS.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.779
&gt;&gt; GEORGINA HAD PROBLEMS TOO.
HER APPETIZER WAS SUPPOSED TO BE

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:48.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
AN ARTICHOKE SLIDER.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, BUT IT WAS ACTUALLY

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:53.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
JUST A KITTEN ON A HAMBURGER
BUN.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
&gt;&gt; WHAT DID YOU THINK OF THE

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
SALAD?
&gt;&gt; HER SALAD SEEMED LIKE AN

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
AFTERTHOUGHT.
AND SHE OVERDRESSED IT.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:59.292
&gt;&gt; YEAH, IT DIDN'T NEED THE FULL
TUXEDO.

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:02.729
JUST A TIE WOULD HAVE BEEN FINE.
&gt;&gt; AND CLAIR SEEMED TO BE JUST

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.432
PRETENDING TO WASH HER HANDS.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, SHE DIDN'T EVEN TOUCH

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:10.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
THE WATER.
&gt;&gt; LET'S MOVE ON TO THE MAIN

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
COURSE ROUND.
&gt;&gt; I THOUGHT THE WAY CLAIR

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.307
INCORPORATED THE MARSHMALLOW
FLUFF INTO HER STEAK SAUCE WAS

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
REALLY CLEVER.
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUT, MY STEAK WAS RAW.
&gt;&gt; RAW LIKE THE TEMPERATURE OR

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.980
RAW LIKE IT HAD A MOUTH AND KEPT
USING THE "C" WORD?

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT ONE.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GET A LOAD OF THESE
[ BLEEP ].

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I THOUGHT GEORGINA SERVED A
REALLY NICE PLATE OF FOOD.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:29.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL, SHE SERVED ME DIVORCE
PAPERS.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND NOW SHE HAS HALF OF
EVERYTHING.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:35.929
&gt;&gt; BUT YOU HAVE FULL CUSTODY OF
HER KID.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:36.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; BUT KID LIKE GOAT, RIGHT?

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; LET'S TALK ABOUT DESSERT.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:43.369
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, GEORGINA WAS REALLY
DETERMINED SHE WAS GOING TO GET

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:48.641
TO THAT ICE CREAM MACHINE FIRST.
&gt;&gt; I JUST WISH SHE HAD

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:51.344
TRANSFORMED THE CANDY CIGARETTE.
BECAUSE SHE JUST STUCK IT IN THE

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
ICE CREAM.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, ALONG WITH SOME REAL

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:55.415
CIGARETTES.
&gt;&gt; SOUNDS LIKE YOU COULD MAKE A

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:57.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
CASE FOR EITHER ONE TO BE
"CHOPPED" CHAMPION.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:03.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BUT ONE STOOD OUT.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:11.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SO WHOSE DISH IS ON THE
CHOPPING BLOCK?

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:14.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
CHEF GEORGINA, YOU'VE BEEN
CHOPPED.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:17.237
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I'M DEFINITELY
DISAPPOINTED, AND MAYBE I'M NOT

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:22.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
THE "CHOPPED" CHAMPION.
BUT I NEVER SIGNED A RELEASE.

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:23.076
SO Y'ALL CAN'T USE ANY OF THIS.
SUCK IT.

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:26.079
&gt;&gt; AND THAT MEANS CHEF CLAIR IS
THE NEW "CHOPPED" CHAMPION.

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:28.515
&gt;&gt; YES!
&gt;&gt; LET ME KNOW WHEN THE CAMERAS

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:34.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
ARE OFF.
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

